        "fact": {
          "zh": "Q3 能源成本减少 526、汽车销售成本减少 260；能源收入因应退客户金额减少 339，均为百万美元。",
          "en": "Q3 energy cost fell by526 and auto-sales cost by260; energy revenue fell by339 for customer refunds, all USDm."
        },
        "limit": {
          "zh": "确认不等于现金收取；不宣称这是全部正常化调整。",
          "en": "Recognition is not collection; this is not a complete normalization."
